stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> INIT

    INIT --> CALIBRATION
    CALIBRATION --> IDLE

    IDLE --> SEARCH
    IDLE --> ERROR

    SEARCH --> SENSE
    SENSE --> MAP_UPDATE
    MAP_UPDATE --> FLOOD_FILL
    FLOOD_FILL --> NAVIGATION

    NAVIGATION --> TURN
    NAVIGATION --> MOVE

    TURN --> SENSE
    MOVE --> SENSE

    SENSE --> GOAL_CHECK

    GOAL_CHECK --> SEARCH: Goal not reached
    GOAL_CHECK --> GOAL_REACHED: Goal reached

    GOAL_REACHED --> FAST_RUN

    FAST_RUN --> TURN
    FAST_RUN --> MOVE

    SEARCH --> ERROR
    FAST_RUN --> ERROR

    ERROR --> SAFE_STOP

    SAFE_STOP --> IDLE

    GOAL_REACHED --> [*]
